As far as I can tell from source-diving, you're correct, at least as far
as temple aligned priests go.

Bonus for angering cross-aligned priest: 2
Bonus for killing cross-aligned priest: 2
Penalty for killing a generated-peaceful priest of a god other than
Moloch: 15.
Penalty for killing a generated-peaceful priest of Moloch: 0.
Bonus for killing a generated-hostile priest of Moloch: 20.
Bonus for killing a generated-hostile ("renegade") priest of a god other
than Moloch: 15.

Also, of course, for Lawful and Neutral characters there's the slight
matter of losing intrinsic telepathy and two points of luck for
murdering a not-always-hostile non-playermon human with zero or negative
malign.

I haven't checked out how polymorphing the priest affects this
behaviour, except that (obviously) it negates the penalty for murder.
